Animal a = new Animal();

Animal → Class Name / Reference Type
a      → Reference Variable
new    → Object Creation Keyword
Animal() → Constructor

Reference = Animal
Object    = Animal
----------------------------------

Animal a = new Dog();

Animal → Parent Reference Type
a      → Reference Variable
new    → Object Creation Keyword
Dog()  → Child Constructor

Reference = Parent
Object    = Child

✔ Used for Runtime Polymorphism.

Dog d = new Animal(); ❌ Not Allowed
Animal a = new Dog(); ✔ Allowed